00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:35.060
But this 'Naozumi' is your real kid, isn't he?

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:36.190
That's right.

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.270
That's why it's to our advantage.

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:43.360
